JetBrains Mono  (also bundled, selectable)
Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

The bundled font files and license text live in `assets/fonts/jetbrains-mono/`.

Nerd Fonts Symbols Only / Symbols Nerd Font Mono  (symbol fallback fonts)
Bundled from Nerd Fonts `NerdFontsSymbolsOnly`, unmodified, in two versions so
the glyph pack covers both Nerd Font codepoint eras out of the box:
  - v3.4.0  — current layout (`assets/fonts/nerd-fonts-symbols/`).
  - v2.3.3  — legacy layout, fills the PUA slots v3 relocated, e.g. the archway
              `U+F557` and python `U+F81F` (`assets/fonts/nerd-fonts-symbols-v2/`).
Font-level license: MIT. Aggregated glyph sources include MIT, Apache-2.0,
CC-BY-4.0, OFL-1.1, and Unlicense components.

The bundled symbols fonts, MIT license text, per-set credits, license references,
and trademark note live in `assets/fonts/nerd-fonts-symbols/` and
`assets/fonts/nerd-fonts-symbols-v2/`.
